OL,3,GNEWSASeveral schools closed after water
OL,4,Amain bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main has led to several
OL,7,Fschools having to shut for the day.
OL,9,FAbout 3,000 properties near Bath in
OL,10,FSomerset were left without water supply
OL,11,For low pressure after the incident in
OL,12,FPaulton at about 02:00 GMT Tuesday.
OL,14,FBristol Water said on Wednesday morning
OL,15,Fthat supply to customers in Norton Hill
OL,16,Fremained disrupted, adding: "We're
OL,17,Fworking hard to bring the service back
OL,18,Fto normal, but this might take a few
OL,19,Fmore hours."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
