OL,3,GNEWSASeveral schools closed after water
OL,4,Amain bursts
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorton Hill School, Midsomer Norton
OL,7,FSixth Form, Westfield School, Fosse Way
OL,8,FSchool, Mogghill Nursery School and St
OL,9,FBenedict's Catholic Primary School all
OL,10,Fclosed on Wednesday.
